sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant Chat as Rust chat
    participant LLM
    participant Go as Go editor
    FE->>Go: Subscribe to /ws
    FE->>Chat: POST /chat/stream
    Chat->>Go: MCP tools/list
    loop Until the LLM returns a final answer
        Chat->>LLM: Messages and tools
        LLM-->>Chat: Text deltas or tool calls
        Chat-->>FE: SSE message / tool_call
        Chat->>Go: MCP tools/call (when requested)
        Go-->>FE: WebSocket render events (when rendering)
        Go-->>Chat: Tool result
        Chat-->>FE: SSE tool_result
    end
    Chat-->>FE: SSE done (or error)
